    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);font-weight:900;color:#fff;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 20px;">Marriage Registration in the UAE<span style="color:#38B2AC;"> For Civil, Muslim and Foreign Marriages</span></h1>
    <p style="color:#B2F5EA;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8;margin:0 auto 32px;max-width:640px;">
      Marriage registration in the UAE goes wrong when one document is missing or one stamp is wrong. That can delay your spouse visa by weeks. We prepare, attest and translate your documents, so your file is right the first time.
    </p>

    <div class="grid-4" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:0 auto 32px;max-width:760px;">
      {stats.map(s => (
        <div class="stat-card">
          <p style="color:#38B2AC;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 4px;">{s.value}</p>
          <p style="color:#CBD5E0;font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.4;margin:0;">{s.label}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="https://wa.me/971529300200" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#38B2AC;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:0.9rem;padding:13px 28px;border-radius:9999px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(56,178,172,0.4);">
        WhatsApp Us Now
      </a>
      <a href="#contact" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;padding:13px 28px;border-radius:9999px;text-decoration:none;">
        Free Consultation &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ WHAT IS MARRIAGE REGISTRATION ════ -->
<section style="background:#fff;padding:76px 24px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent,transparent 48px,rgba(56,178,172,0.04) 48px,rgba(56,178,172,0.04) 49px);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-60px;width:400px;height:360px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(56,178,172,0.08) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>

  <div class="sec-inner" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="two-col" style="display:flex;gap:52px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">

      <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:420px;">
        <div style="position:relative;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;height:380px;">
          <img src="/images/marriage-registration.webp" alt="What is marriage registration in the UAE" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy" width="800" height="450" />
          <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 45%,rgba(26,32,44,0.72));"></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;bottom:24px;left:24px;right:24px;">
            <p style="color:#81E6D9;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;">Legally Recorded</p>
            <p style="color:#fff;font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;margin:0;">An official certificate from a UAE authority</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="flex:1;min-width:280px;">
        <p style="color:#2D3748;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.75rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;"><span style="display:inline-block;width:28px;height:1px;background:#2D3748;"></span>Overview</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.2rem);font-weight:900;color:#1A202C;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 18px;">What Is Marriage Registration?</h2>
        <p style="color:#4B5563;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">Marriage registration is the legal recording of your marriage with a UAE authority. You then receive an official certificate.</p>
        <p style="color:#1A202C;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 10px;">This certificate matters for many everyday tasks:</p>
        <div style="background:#F0FFFE;border:1px solid #B2F5EA;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          {whatItsFor.map(item => (
            <div class="info-list-item"><span style="color:#38B2AC;font-weight:bold;flex-shrink:0;">→</span>{item}</div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p style="color:#4B5563;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin:0;">A religious ceremony alone does not give you this record. Therefore, register your marriage properly and keep certified copies.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ HOW DOES IT WORK + WHICH ROUTE ════ -->
<section style="background:#F8FAFF;padding:76px 24px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(45,55,72,0.02) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(45,55,72,0.02) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:44px 44px;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:600px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(56,178,172,0.07) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>

  <div class="sec-inner" style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="two-col" style="display:flex;gap:52px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;">

      <div style="flex:1;min-width:280px;">
        <p style="color:#2D3748;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.75rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;"><span style="display:inline-block;width:28px;height:1px;background:#2D3748;"></span>The Process</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.1rem);font-weight:900;color:#1A202C;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;">How Does Marriage Registration Work in the UAE?</h2>
        <p style="color:#4B5563;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px;">Marriage registration in the UAE depends on your route. Muslim couples register a marriage contract through the court. Eligible non Muslim couples can choose a civil marriage in Dubai or Abu Dhabi. Couples married abroad need marriage certificate attestation instead.</p>
        <p style="color:#4B5563;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0;">Therefore, confirm your route first. Then prepare your documents, attestation and certified Arabic translation.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:380px;">
        <img src="/images/img-78.webp" alt="Marriage registration documents" style="width:100%;height:320px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);" loading="lazy" width="800" height="450" />
      </div>

    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;margin:56px 0 32px;">
      <p style="color:#2D3748;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Find Your Route</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:900;color:#1A202C;margin:0 0 12px;">Marriage Registration in Abu Dhabi and Dubai: Which Route Fits You?</h2>
      <p style="color:#4B5563;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;">Your religion, residence and marriage history decide your route.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;">
      {routeFit.map(r => (
        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>{r.title}</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.65;margin:0;">{r.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ ROUTES COMPARED ════ -->
<section style="background:#fff;padding:76px 24px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent,transparent 48px,rgba(56,178,172,0.04) 48px,rgba(56,178,172,0.04) 49px);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>

  <div class="sec-inner" style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px;">
      <p style="color:#2D3748;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Quick Comparison</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:900;color:#1A202C;margin:0 0 16px;">Marriage Registration Routes Compared: Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Court and Embassy</h2>
      <p style="color:#4B5563;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;">Use this quick comparison to see where you fit. Rules change, so we confirm the live position for you.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cmp-wrap">
      <table class="cmp-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Point</th>
            {compareCols.map(c => <th>{c}</th>)}
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {compareRows.map(row => (
            <tr>
              <td>{row.point}</td>
              {row.vals.map(v => <td>{v}</td>)}
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ CIVIL + MUSLIM ════ -->
<section style="background:#F0FFFE;padding:76px 24px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(45,55,72,0.02) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(45,55,72,0.02) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:44px 44px;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>

  <div class="sec-inner" style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px;">
      <p style="color:#2D3748;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Civil Marriage</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:900;color:#1A202C;margin:0 0 16px;">Civil Marriage in Dubai and Abu Dhabi: What the Process Looks Like</h2>
      <p style="color:#4B5563;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;">Both emirates use an application, a review and a signing. However, each follows its own rules.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:56px;">
      {civilSteps.map(s => (
        <div class="step-card">
          <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#2D3748;color:#38B2AC;font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">{s.num}</div>
          <div>
            <p style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:700;color:#1A202C;margin:0 0 5px;">{s.title}</p>
